[[File:Voidwaker detail.png|left|150px]]
The '''Voidwaker''' is a melee weapon that requires level 75 [[Attack]] to wield. It is acquired by providing the [[Voidwaker blade]], [[Voidwaker hilt|hilt]], and [[Voidwaker gem|gem]] to [[Madam Sikaro]] in the [[Ferox Enclave Dungeon]], who will reassemble the weapon for a fee of {{NoCoins|500000|c}}. The three parts are obtained separately as rare drops from [[Vet'ion]], [[Callisto]], and [[Venenatis]] (or their lesser counterparts) respectively. Its base stats are roughly comparable to an [[abyssal whip]], and it has one of the most powerful damaging special attacks of any weapon in the game.

Attempting to combine the pieces on your own displays the message {{mes|You don't think you have the skills to reassemble this weapon yourself.}}.

